    {
      "id": "6de6ca2e7086",
      "name": "Lusha-Twenty Inbox Sync",
      "prompt": "[IMPORTANT: You are running as a scheduled cron job. DELIVERY: Your final response will be automatically delivered to the user — do NOT use send_message or try to deliver the output yourself. SILENT: If there is genuinely nothing new to report, respond with exactly \"[SILENT]\" (nothing else). Never combine [SILENT] with content.\n\nThe Lusha→Twenty inbox watcher ALREADY RAN as this job's pre-step (lusha_inbox_sync.sh — deterministic, interpreter-pinned). Its log is ~/twenty/sync_lusha.log.\nYour ONLY job: read the tail of that log and report the outcome in <=5 bullets: how many leads were found, how many enriched/upserted into Twenty, any errors.\nDO NOT run any commands except reading the log file. DO NOT write files. DO NOT run the watcher again. If no leads were processed today, respond with exactly: [SILENT]",
